2025 rosa technolagies exam prototype program


Project Description

this program is for a carbon footprint, energy calculator and booking website for the hyperthitcal company rosa technolagies, this is a prototype based on the breif that was given.


how to install and run the project

1. download the the folder for the project
2. unzip the folder into desired location 
3. open the folder in your perfered code editor
4. go to the main.py file and run the file 
5. got to the output and follow the local host link
6. the webiste should now be displayed

useage of the program

this is meant to be a prototype for rosa technolagies its primary functions are:
- to be able to be able to book a consultation and installations
- to be able to input carbon or energy useage infomation to be calculated
- to have a registration and login system to allow for accounts


